"    forward: {},\n"
"},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:1996
msgid ""
"The empty object turns forwarding on with the defaults. Each node then "
"listens on its mesh address at the next port, here 7947, for TCP and UDP. "
"We open that port between the nodes and to nobody else. ``forward`` is a "
"change of the mesh, so it takes a restart of each node, one at a time. A "
"node without it is never chosen as an owner, so a cluster can be changed "
"node by node."
